ame focused on <strong>exploration</strong>, <strong>tension</strong>, and <strong>atmosphere</strong>.<br>Inside an <strong>abandoned</strong> <strong>asylum</strong>, every file and every room hides traces of unauthorized experiments.<br>As you dig deeper, reality and memory begin to overlap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062770/extras/41a3cb3829fda6408753f7c66e3decd1.poster.avif?t=1765051684\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062770/extras/41a3cb3829fda6408753f7c66e3decd1.webm?t=1765051684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062770/extras/41a3cb3829fda6408753f7c66e3decd1.mp4?t=1765051684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ephraim</strong>, an <strong>archivist</strong> sent on a banal mission, ended up living a <strong>nightmare</strong>. Sent to retrieve patient records from an <strong>asylum</strong> that had been <strong>closed in 1984</strong>. Soon realizes the place wasn\u2019t just for treatment. With every door opened, every note found, every new discovery, his memory begins to unfold. He begins to understand that his past is deeply connected to what happened there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062770/extras/406658dfc2514dc743d9e79e17f33084.poster.avif?t=1765051684\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062770/extras/406658dfc2514dc743d9e79e17f33084.webm?t=1765051684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062770/extras/406658dfc2514dc743d9e79e17f33084.mp4?t=1765051684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> <strong>Body A</strong> and <strong>Body</strong>\u00a0<strong>B</strong> of the <strong>asylum</strong>, gather documents, unlock doors, and piece together the twisted history of <strong>Subject 33</strong>. Each room hides clues, personal notes, and files left behind by staff and patients. The more you discover, the more dangerous the asylum becomes\u2014as if someone or something is trying to prevent you from uncovering the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a rich and atmospheric <strong>narrative</strong>, full of <strong>psychological tension</strong>, <strong>environmental storytelling</strong>, and puzzles. You'll <strong>collect</strong> 40 patient files, unlock hidden passages, and reveal the secret of <u><strong>Body C</strong></u>, where the real story lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062770/extras/e1d5f7f4e6d48a1f19eb18aa0fc8f184.poster.avif?t=1765051684\" width=940 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062770/extras/e1d5f7f4e6d48a1f19eb18aa0fc8f184.webm?t=1765051684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062770/extras/e1d5f7f4e6d48a1f19eb18aa0fc8f184.mp4?t=1765051684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udddd <strong>Story-Rich Gameplay:</strong> A psychological narrative slowly revealed through notes, files, and environmental clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong> Explore dark corridors, generator-powered lights, and sound design that keeps you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzles &amp; Secrets:</strong> Unlock doors, find hidden objects, and solve puzzles to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfad <strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> Experience moments where reality bends, hallucinations strike, and your perception is challenged.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Full Voice Acting:</strong> Fully voiced prologue and key dialogue sequences for a cinematic experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Collectible Lore:</strong> 40 unique patient files, personal letters, and secret notes to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc41 <strong>First-Person Exploration:</strong> For maximum immersion and tension.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Matei Mihai"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062770/e73d56b345ff19651b715f425b76dd2be483420e/header.jpg?t=1765051684","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4062770/942382971/cf75ffb134086bc37b4dae085be4150efea78cbc/1763076706/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763077715","dash_h264":"